# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional AI coding agents — pick one or both; uncomment to install via brew
# where a formula exists, or follow the manual install in .config/pi/README.md
# and .config/opencode/README.md. Provider keys live in ~/.zsh_local (opsecret).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# pi (pi.dev) — multi-provider TUI agent (Claude, Gemini, OpenAI, Copilot…).
#   brew install pi           # if a formula is available, otherwise:
#   bun add -g @earendil-works/pi-coding-agent
#   curl -fsSL https://pi.dev/install.sh | sh
#
# opencode — TUI coding agent (Anthropic, OpenAI, local models, …).
#   brew install opencode     # if a formula is available, otherwise:
#   bun add -g opencode-ai
#   See https://opencode.ai for the latest install method.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
